<title>UK: EBRD lending at a glance.</title>
<headline>EBRD lending at a glance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>In 1996, the European Bank for Reconstruction and Development committed funds to 95 new projects worth 2.188 billion Ecu compared with 110 projects worth 2.0 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>In 1996 operating income was 243.7 million, generating operating profit before provisions of 97.3 million against income of 241.2 million in 1995 and an 82.9 million profit.</p>
<p>Outstanding disbursements totalled 3.2 billion in 1996 compared with 2.08 billion in 1995.</p>
